WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
And a very serious person, too, I have to tell you.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.400
I've been watching him for a long time.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.100
Is Andy here?

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:07.940
That's what I thought.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:08.760
Hello, Andy.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.180
I thought that was you.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.080
You're looking better than you do out on those streets, huh?

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.560
You look much better.

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:16.879
It's nice to have you.

00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:18.840
You feel a little safer here, I think, maybe.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.000
Well, not that safe, because you have them.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.840
You have to worry about them.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.840
But thank you very much.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.559
Andy Noah has been repeatedly beaten by Antifa,

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:32.000
and including one assault that left him with a brain hemorrhage.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.520
Only days ago, Nick Sauter was assaulted in Portland

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.680
by a flag-burning mob.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.160
And we've made it a one-year penalty for inciting riots.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.119
We took the freedom of speech away,

00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:47.180
because that's been through the courts.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.959
And the courts said, you have freedom of speech.

00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:53.959
But what has happened is when they burn a flag,

00:00:53.959 --> 00:00:56.639
it agitates and irritates crowds.

00:00:56.639 --> 00:00:58.759
They've never seen anything like it on both sides.

00:00:58.759 --> 00:01:00.360
And you end up with riots.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.919
So we're going on that basis.

00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:05.080
We're looking at it not from the freedom of speech, which

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.919
I always felt strongly about, but never passed the courts.

00:01:08.919 --> 00:01:11.320
This is what they do, is they incite.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.739
When you burn an American flag, you incite tremendous violence.

00:01:14.739 --> 00:01:18.000
We have many examples of it, many, many examples of it.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.760
And it's actually down on tape.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.440
And you see things happen that just don't happen,

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.120
unless it's a flag that's burning.

